// Break() with no value: the AppServer refuses it as a statement and in a
// block, "C2003 Syntax Error" in TL++, "Use of reserved language word
// (BREAK)" in AdvPL; Break alone, and Break(Nil), it takes (probe xdr, on
// 24.3.1.9).
User Function Taken()
  Begin Sequence
    Break()
  Recover
    ConOut("taken")
  End Sequence
  Begin Sequence
    Eval({|| Break()})
  Recover
    ConOut("taken")
  End Sequence
  Begin Sequence
    Break
  Recover
    ConOut("taken")
  End Sequence
Return Nil
